sequenceDiagram
    participant L as Legacy service
    participant J as Java / data handoff
    participant M as Integration API
    participant DB as DB Repository
    participant R as Redis
    participant C as Common API (A or B)
    participant F as FCM
    participant D as Flutter client
    L->>J: message request + messageId
    J->>M: hand off same messageId
    M->>R: inspect delivery status
    M->>DB: recipient / device token lookup
    DB-->>M: active device data
    M->>R: read badge state
    M->>C: send request
    C->>R: read access token
    C->>F: send
    F-->>C: result
    C-->>M: result
    M->>R: update outcome / badge state
    F-->>D: notification
